  entry .frozenArray
    info
        - draws a frozen `Array[element]^{}` sized by the `Random.Size` in scope
        + tire un `Array[element]^{}` gelé dimensionné par le `Random.Size` dans la portée
    detail
        - Needs a `ClassTag` for the element type as well as a `Random.Size`.
